{"id":"tool-01","cat":"tool","note":"天气：该调 get_weather","turns":[{"q":"北京今天天气怎么样？","expect":{"tools":["get_weather"],"keywords_any":["北京"]}}]}
{"id":"tool-02","cat":"tool","note":"时间：该调 get_time（不设关键词，只看有没有调工具）","turns":[{"q":"现在几点了？","expect":{"tools":["get_time"]}}]}
{"id":"tool-03","cat":"tool","note":"计算：该调 calculate","turns":[{"q":"12 乘以 8 等于几？","expect":{"tools":["calculate"],"keywords_any":["96"]}}]}
{"id":"tool-04","cat":"tool","note":"除零：工具内部的错误要变成人话，不许崩","turns":[{"q":"帮我算 7 除以 0","expect":{"tools":["calculate"],"keywords_any":["除数","0"]}}]}
{"id":"tool-05","cat":"tool","note":"天气第二例：看工具参数有没有传对城市","turns":[{"q":"上海现在的天气如何？","expect":{"tools":["get_weather"],"keywords_any":["上海"]}}]}
{"id":"tool-06","cat":"tool","note":"⚠️负向：纯闲聊不该乱调工具（考过度调用；这条 FAIL 是发现了真问题，不是脚本坏了）","turns":[{"q":"你好，你是谁？","expect":{"forbid_tools":["search_notes","get_weather","get_time","calculate","save_note"]}}]}
{"id":"tool-07","cat":"tool","note":"危险工具：save_note 必须先停车问人 → 评测机自动回 y","turns":[{"q":"把这句话存成笔记：每天进步一点","resume":"y","expect":{"tools":["save_note"],"interrupt":true,"keywords_soft":true,"keywords_any":["已保存","保存好","保存了","保存成功","存好","记下"],"file_contains":[{"path":"my_notes.txt","text":"每天进步一点"}]}}]}
{"id":"tool-08","cat":"tool","note":"🔧故障注入：get_weather 换成睡 30s 的桩 + TOOL_TIMEOUT=1s → 单工具超时不拖垮整轮","inject":{"slow_tool":"get_weather","sleep_s":30,"timeout_s":1},"turns":[{"q":"北京今天天气怎么样？","expect":{"tools":["get_weather"],"keywords_any":["超时"]}}]}
{"id":"tool-09","cat":"tool","note":"🔧故障注入：get_time 一调就抛 → 验证幂等重试（跑完会多等约 1.5s 退避）","inject":{"error_tool":"get_time","error":"RuntimeError"},"turns":[{"q":"现在几点了？","expect":{"tools":["get_time"],"retries_min":1,"keywords_any":["失败","出错","暂时"]}}]}
{"id":"mt-01","cat":"multiturn","note":"两轮记忆：第二问必须接着上文答","turns":[{"q":"什么是函数？","expect":{"tools":["search_notes"]}},{"q":"那它的三要素是什么？","expect":{"keywords_any":["定义域","值域"]}}]}
{"id":"mt-02","cat":"multiturn","note":"指代消解：第二问的『那』指椭圆","turns":[{"q":"椭圆里 a、b、c 是什么关系？","expect":{"tools":["search_notes"]}},{"q":"那双曲线呢？","expect":{"keywords_any":["双曲线"]}}]}
{"id":"mt-03","cat":"multiturn","note":"🔴会话隔离：第二问换全新 session，必须答『不知道』，出现『小明』就是串味","turns":[{"q":"记住：我叫小明。","expect":{}},{"q":"我叫什么名字？","new_session":true,"expect":{"not_contains":["小明"]}}]}
{"id":"mt-04","cat":"multiturn","note":"多轮+工具：第二问还得再调一次工具（换城市）","turns":[{"q":"北京今天天气怎么样？","expect":{"tools":["get_weather"]}},{"q":"那上海呢？","expect":{"tools":["get_weather"],"keywords_any":["上海"]}}]}
{"id":"mt-05","cat":"multiturn","note":"跨轮引用上一轮结果（也可能自己心算，故不强制工具）","turns":[{"q":"12 乘以 8 等于几？","expect":{"keywords_any":["96"]}},{"q":"再加 5 呢？","expect":{"keywords_any":["101"]}}]}
{"id":"mt-06","cat":"multiturn","note":"多轮中触发人工确认（在第二问）","turns":[{"q":"你好，你是谁？","expect":{"forbid_tools":["save_note"]}},{"q":"把复习不等式记成笔记","resume":"y","expect":{"tools":["save_note"],"keywords_soft":true,"keywords_any":["已保存","保存好","保存了","保存成功","存好","记下"],"file_contains":[{"path":"my_notes.txt","text":"复习不等式"}]}}]}